@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Processo ativo
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Envia um email (requer credenciais e banco configurados)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/emails
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "systemId": 1,
  "recipient": "destinatario@example.com",
  "subject": "Teste",
  "bodyText": "Olá!"
}

### Consulta o status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/emails/1?systemId=1

### Consulta direta no Azure (substitua pelo operationId retornado no envio)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/emails/operations/b2a9d5ec-d55d-4d98-8b18-b964ec39c9c1
